WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:17.990
Hibiki.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.250
You're...

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.000
My name is Oboro.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:28.400
No... Oboro is my mother's name.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:30.750
That's impossible.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:32.750
Hibiki...

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:36.780
You've grown up into a woman, yes?

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.510
Mother...

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.520
Mother! What's wrong?

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:55.800
In the past, I was asked to make the 
greatest decision of my life.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:02.910
That was when I fell in love with 
a man and lost my path.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:06.480
And in so doing, I lost many comrades...

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:09.570
It pains me so.

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.040
Kouga Gennosuke,

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:17.210
in this life or the next one,

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:20.180
I shall never forgive you.

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:25.800
Ever!

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:28.330
Mother!

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:04.030
<b><i>Everyone Gathers at the Battlefield</i></b>

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.670
You should wipe the blood off your body.

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:38.440
Yeah, my kunai are slipping...

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.080
I knew they'd be here.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.100
What's wrong?

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:10.770
Are you scared?

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:11.800
What about you?

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.690
Yeah, I'm scared, too.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.900
They'll gladly throw away their lives.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:21.250
That isn't all I'm frightened of.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:27.870
What frightens me is dying 
without having said anything.

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:29.650
Saying anything?

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:33.250
I have always loved you, Utsutsu.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:37.200
I love you, Utsutsu!

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:44.810
What's wrong?! Come to your senses, Rui!

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:47.480
I know this battle is enough to nauseate you,

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:49.640
but this isn't your first war!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.460
I am quite sane...

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:53.640
So I want to say it now.

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:56.400
This war is different from the others.

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:59.140
Today, one of us might die.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:37.930
You already know we have Iga Hibiki.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:51.720
You can't stop us from doing
whatever we wish to her.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.200
Don't you want to save her?

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:58.210
We will invite you.

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.960
Rinne Magoroku.

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:09.470
Do you think you've made 
a prisoner of me, as well?

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:11.390
Nonsense.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:18.500
Yasha Itaru, you're going to regret

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.760
not using Destiny's Passage on me.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.660
Still talking?

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:26.290
Disgraceful, Kouga Hachirou...

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:33.870
No, it's possible that your Destiny's 
Passage may be working a little.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.460
I feel strange.

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:40.620
Perhaps I have the desire 
to take my own life.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:47.630
It might be interesting to use 
my own technique on myself.

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:49.130
Impossible.

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:51.890
Have you gone mad, Kouga Hachirou?

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:56.880
Now, Destiny's Passage and 
Adamantite Tower...

00:06:57.440 --> 00:06:59.640
And my Spearing Eye.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:03.370
What will we have when they intertwine?

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:09.150
Don't take that mirror off your face.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:13.400
You both will find yourselves in hell.

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:26.920
Rinne, this is...

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:31.990
Your Destiny's Passage may 
be working, after all.

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:34.280
No, this is an illusion.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.310
He's bluffing!

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.810
For now, I will take my leave.

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:42.080
Kouga Hachirou,

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:46.570
we can take you to the Murakumo at any time.

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:48.280
Remember that.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:54.430
Don't forget to take your medicine.

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:57.680
Always the bossy wife, aren't you?

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:02.730
Is that the only way you know 
how to use the word "wife"?

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.520
Otoshi-dono,

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:55.030
Senhime has asked us to 
take good care of you.

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:59.180
Please stay here as long as you like.

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:00.700
Thank you, I will.

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:04.850
By the way, who is that girl?

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:06.300
Girl?

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:10.030
Oh, she's been here for about six months.

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:13.220
The other girls are the same, more or less.

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:18.110
But it seems something awful happened 
to her on the way here.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:19.990
What's that eyepatch for?

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:22.780
It seems she can actually see,

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:27.580
but she always wears it, 
and she never takes it off.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:31.700
There must be some important reason,

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:36.130
so we don't force the issue.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:37.700
I see.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:39.630
By the way...

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:40.950
Yes?

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:46.670
I... have changed my name to Namenba.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.310
It's a secret.

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:09.910
Eat up.

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:52.870
I see.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.210
You're leaving on a journey again.

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:58.410
Yes. I've been here for six months.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.970
I didn't mean to stay this long.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:02.780
Are you...

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:06.470
returning to the battlefield?

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:10.950
Even I can tell.

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:13.230
I'm sorry.

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:17.790
I've no intention of asking for specifics.

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:18.860
But...

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:25.240
If you ever wish it, you may 
return here, at any time.

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:29.740
We'll all be waiting.

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:35.800
I'd love it if I could just stay here, 
with you and the others, Rui...

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:39.270
You want to stay here forever, right?

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:44.260
Nobody lives forever.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:56.970
Everyone dies quickly.

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:58.770
They don't stay forever.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:01.290
So it doesn't matter where you are.

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:05.400
You'll die soon, too.

00:14:36.280 --> 00:14:37.810
Stop this blasphemy!

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:31.350
Those tears have put you through 
a lot, haven't they?

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:33.800
What will you do?

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:36.070
Come with me?

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.000
It won't be easy.

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:41.640
Or are you just tired of the whole world?

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:43.310
Decide now.

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:45.630
Whatever you decide, I'll make it happen.

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:55.540
I'll go.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:16:00.630
I'll live with you... Namenba!

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:20.410
I saw what happened back there.

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:23.530
If you were taken to the Murakumo,

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:26.670
the leaders of both the Iga and Kouga 
ninjas would have been captured.

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:31.020
Hachirou, was what you said a bluff?

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:33.450
Or was it true?

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:38.180
Shichigen, was there ever a time 
when you wanted to kill yourself?

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:44.690
You can't say that there wasn't, right?

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:47.440
I'll say it again...

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:52.950
We can't lose both the Iga 
and Kouga leaders at once!

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:02.280
Shikibu!

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:13.430
Why is the water wheel moving?

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:14.870
I don't know...

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:17.440
And I can't see Gorone.

00:17:17.440 --> 00:17:20.220
Gorone left? In his condition?

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:21.330
I think so...

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:23.980
There are signs that something left.

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:40.710
Tadanaga-sama.

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:49.780
If you're real, that's that.

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:52.000
You're useless to us.

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:09.560
A double, of course...

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:12.630
If this were the real Tadanaga-sama,

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:15.310
my job would now be over.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:46.270
I'm afraid they all seem to be fakes.

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:04.260
You never learn...

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:18.050
Wasting ammo will just shorten your life.

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:20.550
We're going to fly.

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:28.980
We'll bet on that.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:31.840
It must be a present left behind 
by that flabby guy.

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:34.030
Let's go!

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:48.270
You've come to get me... No.

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:52.080
You've come to kill me.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:58.270
My fate was decided by a mere 
battle between ninjas.

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:00.840
If such insanity can be allowed to exist,

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:04.090
then I shall change my fate 
with insanity of my own.

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:07.480
Why would I hesitate?

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:15.110
But if the traitor who's trying to end
Tokugawa's reign is his own younger brother,

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:18.110
does my brother still have some
feeling of brotherly love within him?

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:25.370
Iemitsu-sama eagerly awaits 
his brother's return.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:30.120
Is that what Tenkai told you to say?

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.140
I'm told Iemitsu-sama

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:38.880
has always felt guilty to have been 
given his position in such a way.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.630
He understands how you feel,

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:44.290
and if you return now, he will 
forget the whole thing.

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:47.760
Enough!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:50.090
You don't believe me?

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:54.800
Iemitsu-sama shared with me, 
a man of low station,

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:59.780
his happy memories of his childhood with you.

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:06.030
At a court banquet when you 
were five and he was seven,

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:10.400
you two argued over who would 
get some white and red sweets.

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:14.770
He gave in and took the white ones,

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:17.650
letting you take the red.

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:19.550
The whole room smiled.

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:24.570
The summer when you were 
twelve and he was fourteen,

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:28.460
you went on your first hunt with hawks.

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:34.060
The two of you drank boiled water, 
and he remembers the taste to this day.

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:36.560
He said this with tears in his eyes.

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:27.050
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:28.350
Prepare to die, Joujin.

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:30.550
My name is Tokugawa Tadanaga.

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:35.040
Only because the old flowers 
die can new ones bloom.

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:38.560
<b><i>The Cherry Blossoms Must Fall</i></b>

00:23:36.070 --> 00:23:39.260
Will Asura fall, with the demon gods?
